   <title>Scenario 11: table in a task topic</title>
   <shortdesc>Consider a "Compare Settings" chapter in a "Configuration Guide" document where you want to add</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>table</keyword>
