   <refbody>  <section>
    <p>Consider a "Compare Settings" chapter in a "Configuration Guide" document where you want to add a table in the info tag.</p>
      <codeblock id="codeblock_ys2_tqs_kkc">&lt;task id="compare-settings" title="Compare Configuration Settings"&gt;
&lt;shortdesc&gt;Compare recommended and legacy settings for the application.&lt;/shortdesc&gt;
&lt;steps&gt;
&lt;step id="step-1"&gt;
&lt;cmd&gt;Open the configuration comparison view.&lt;/cmd&gt;
&lt;step id-“step-2”&gt;
&lt;cmd&gt; Use the following table to compare recommended vs legacy settings:&lt;/cmd&gt;
&lt;info&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
&lt;table frame="all" cols="3"&gt;
&lt;tgroup cols="3"&gt;
&lt;colspec colname="c1" colwidth="1*"/&gt;
&lt;colspec colname="c2" colwidth="1*"/&gt;
&lt;colspec colname="c3" colwidth="1*"/&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;row&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;Setting&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;Recommended&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;Legacy&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;/row&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;row&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;Connection timeout&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;30s&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;60s&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;/row&gt;
&lt;row&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;Retry attempts&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;3&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;5&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;/row&gt;
&lt;row&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;Logging level&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;INFO&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;entry&gt;DEBUG&lt;/entry&gt;
&lt;/row&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/tgroup&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/info&gt;
&lt;/step&gt;…
&lt;/steps&gt;
&lt;result&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Choose the recommended settings unless troubleshooting requires legacy modes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/result&gt;
&lt;/task&gt;</codeblock><p>
         <b>Result:</b> Add the table inside a <codeph>&lt;p&gt;</codeph> tag to prevent it from running off the page in output.</p>
  </section></refbody>
</reference>